╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║  VINKIUS_CATALOG_TOKEN is required to use the MCP Catalog.      ║
╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

Follow these steps to get started:

  1. Sign up or log in at https://cloud.vinkius.com
  2. Go to Settings → Catalog Tokens
     https://cloud.vinkius.com/settings/catalog-tokens
  3. Click "Create catalog token" and copy the vk_catalog_* token
  4. Add it to your MCP client configuration:

     claude_desktop_config.json:
     {
       "mcpServers": {
         "vinkius": {
           "command": "npx",
           "args": ["-y", "@vinkius-core/discover-mcp"],
           "env": {
             "VINKIUS_CATALOG_TOKEN": "vk_catalog_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE"
           }
         }
       }
     }

  5. Restart your AI agent
